WEBVTT

00:00:01.518 --> 00:00:04.237
Open Number Pools and click Add pool

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:10.120
Name the pool

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:20.242
Add numbers to the pool

00:00:20.242 --> 00:00:28.366
Turn on Auto purchase and pick a country

00:00:28.366 --> 00:00:32.261
Click Create pool

00:00:32.261 --> 00:00:33.966
Your new pool appears as a card

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:37.166
Click a card to open the pool page

00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:38.868
Manage numbers, tags and Auto purchase here

00:00:38.868 --> 00:00:45.673
Add more numbers from the pool page

00:00:45.673 --> 00:00:53.487
A spam-flagged number is skipped in rotation
